    "title": "New trial denied for man convicted of killing Hermann officer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elijah James, KOMU 8 Digital Producer ,\n17 hours ago A judge has denied a motion for a second trial for Kenneth Lee Simpson, the man convicted in the 2023 killing of Hermann police Sgt. Mason Griffith. Simpson was found guilty Jan. 24 by a Franklin County jury on charges including first-degree murder and first-degree assault for the March 2023 shooting that killed Griffith and seriously wounded officer Adam Sullentrup. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
